# Fathom

Fathom is the enterprise intelligence layer of the Mitari platform. Where
[Wyrd](/overview/) is the open-core substrate — the typed model, registry, and
lineage — Fathom reads that model to verify how your AI systems behave: leakage
detection, eval as evidence, drift versus spec, and audit.

**Wyrd captures every stage; Fathom reasons across all of it.**

Fathom is not yet released. For how the two pillars fit together, see
[Where Wyrd fits](/overview/where-wyrd-fits/).
